= Bronisław Ziemięcki

Ziemięcki represents the Piłsudczyk current while favoring conditional parliamentary cooperation.

- @emergency_fundraising
- @municipal_socialism
- @root: Return to main

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources: the party's money grows at once (+2).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'ziemiecki', 'emergency_fundraising').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_emergency_fundraising_why +]
